You’re drifting away you’re drifting away
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
When you come to the river Jesus don’t give thee command
You’re drifting away you’re drifting away
And the dark rollin’ river takes you to the sinkin’ sand
You’re drifting away you’re drifting away
{end_of_verse}

